hp?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 25 (page does not exist)\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017221635\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 246/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2333/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 593/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5948/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.577      1 Template:CEMC_box\n100.00%    7.577      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:34268:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017221635 and revision id 281830. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}